<title>UZBEKISTAN: Uzbek GDP up 3.6 pct in Jan-June 97 vs 1.4 pct 96.</title>
<headline>Uzbek GDP up 3.6 pct in Jan-June 97 vs 1.4 pct 96.</headline>
<dateline>TASHKENT 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Uzbekistan's gross domestic product (GDP) grew in January-June of this year by 3.6 percent, compared to a rise of 1.4 percent in the same period last year, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    UZBEK GDP			  Jan-Jun 97  Jan-Jun 96</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	  +3.6	  +1.4</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
